  "note": "The w > 0 half, the E₁ step (E₁(1/200) = 4.726 < log 200 = 5.298) and the second inequality (1 − e^{−1/H} < 1/H) are fine. Erratum: (A.36) fails for small t: |h - h_H|/t first exceeds the right side near t = 9.21e-8 (H = 200) and t = 1.08e-4 (H = 25) and grows without bound (3657 at t = 1e-12, H = 200), so |(h - h_H)/t|_oo is infinite. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_a_36.py`)."
